{
  "job_B1.9.4_20261116_201727": {
    "chunk_text": "t Gode, for \u00f0\u00e6s \u00d0a b\u00e6d se witega eft \u00e6t Gode \u00fe\u00e6t he his folce miltsian sceolde, & him renas & eor\u00f0lice w\u00e6stmas \u00d0a astah he up on anre dune, & gebigedum cneowum geb\u00e6d for \u00f0am folce, & het his cnapan \u00f0a hwile \u00dea \u00e6t nextan cw\u00e6\u00f0 se cnapa \u00fe\u00e6t he gesawe arisan of \u00f0\u00e6re s\u00e6 an lytel wolcn, & \u00f0\u00e6rrihte asweartode Hit is swa swa we \u00e6r s\u00e6don, \u00fe\u00e6t seo lyft atih\u00f0 up of \u00f0\u00e6re eor\u00f0an, & of \u00f0\u00e6re s\u00e6 ealne \u00f0one w\u00e6tan, \u00fee \u00d0\u00e6re lyfte gecynd is \u00fe\u00e6t heo sic\u00f0 \u00e6lcne w\u00e6tan upp to hire. \u00d0is m\u00e6g sceawian se \u00f0e wile, hu se w\u00e6ta g\u00e6\u00f0 upp, swilce mid smice o\u00f0\u00f0e mid miste, & gif hit sealt So\u00f0lice Godes miht gefada\u00f0 ealle gewederu, se \u00f0e ealle \u00f0ing buton earfo\u00f0nysse gediht. He n\u00e6re na \u00e6lmihtig, gif him \u00e6nig gefadung earfo\u00f0e w\u00e6re. His nama is omnipotens, \u00fe\u00e6t is \u00e6lmihtig, for\u00f0an \u00f0e he m\u00e6g eal \u00fe\u00e6t he wile, & his miht nawar ne DE GRANDINE. Hagol cym\u00f0 of \u00f0am rendropum, \u00feonne hi beo\u00f0 gefrorene upp on \u00fe\u00e6re lyfte, & swa si\u00f0\u00f0an fealla\u00f0. DE NIUE. Snaw cym\u00f0 of \u00f0am \u00f0ynnum w\u00e6tan, \u00fee bi\u00f0 uppatogen mid \u00fe\u00e6re lyfte, & bi\u00f0 gefroren \u00e6r \u00f0an \u00f0e he to DE TON",
